{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】「魔法風雲會」攤位報導！Marvel合作內容及新手教學講座炒熱會場</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6ce198168218664a16ca939998c8720e4a40afd5378c736ce5fc2867071a842a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F12cdcaf79caa788dc5c8e0216fb566ca.jpg\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)～28日(二)舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」－「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 本次為大家介紹卡牌遊戲金字塔「 魔法風雲會 」(以下稱MTG)的攤位！</p><h3>【ACGHK 2026】「MTG」攤位報導！Marvel合作BOX以會場特別價格販售</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1502d339cb2aaa0fb881be52ee6a70fb03133add87d3a3bc3724377712f7ca06/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0dfdd56cb0c5c4cc580d8dc38af9a025.jpg\"/><p>一起來看看集換式卡牌遊戲「 MTG 」的攤位！ 正在展開與Marvel的合作內容，現場空前盛況。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7ffb081677640de5fc1108a23ec217e53fa109e0411370fd10180ffa52444f0e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa7c9cd280191e426842ad54805a222e8.jpg\"/><p>攤位內舉辦了購買指定商品即可獲贈Play Booster或限定襟章的活動！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ca628e00ed7022832658e612d6aad5564ee779b0dd78fd07071c847229a17cc1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F77251ba20e5fc7e622d90d5e36dfc868.jpg\"/><p>針對即將開始玩MTG的新手，販售了「 魔法風雲會：漫威超級英雄 」的新手盒。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0e3a786a0b141d2f2181d87bcda83ec6cc394abb8ee071530886fe3ddb71b784/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2306f6b2cc3d1abc3d7a21cbc48eeba0.jpg\"/><p>新手盒從原價350港元，以特別價格280港元販售。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f28403ba4345de36d3b55e1936f8e1e29fafa211e5d3fe17412a19c445b47540/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3cb7e4ae73815f1ff86ab2cc7b00e8a5.jpg\"/><p>此外，購買BOX即可獲贈價值65港元的Play Booster與限定襟章，是相當超值的組合。 從這裡開始接觸MTG或許也是不錯的選擇。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7f90696e78491c3c471a4c0dea1bcc15a291b881051214a53778cb258c78620f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F17d1ac629f03cc9eeedc789187cfc314.jpg\"/><p>現場也販售了1包350港元的收藏家高級補充包。 會開出什麼樣的卡片呢。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/aade00a9949843cb4581d4d60288f9329f19ec5a00ceb2c1ea4f2c8cc3a5c868/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F36545bac6ab6f76d56893f4ebfa7b1f4.jpg\"/><p>現場還有580港元的組合包。 這個組合包也是收藏家取向，似乎內含多張稀有卡。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/88a3953d6b11969c5941f2843d3d2609acb123b84dac10c7dd2057f2b3465141/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F90a38e4c7676befc0f2b730cd6298f57.jpg\"/><p>場景盒裝組2盒售價580港元。 由於是風格統一的卡牌套組，擺在房間裡裝飾也不錯。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/34372541570325ca70456337df1881f94b1da35577d51a04ed16fc43ceb25a9f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F36cc24dcb831b094d4badbf8c060fe77.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/22e38e0e94452337a8054b44be2a36cf5e6fd200c87c05c2c2695c7ba82f9b17/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fea6ed6a5ad7045b9c2f22a68a212696a.jpg\"/><p>現場也有實際陳列在對戰墊上的卡片。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8aeb4c51837082e318a6310c918c8326b08b4bafd416b31ea343b4b1b1a12fb4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F764598ff56ce7a73f6c7ff1d94058963.jpg\"/><p>現場舉辦了新手教學講座。 參加即可獲贈限定貼紙。 此外，註冊Wizards of the Coast帳戶可獲贈Welcome Deck，在對戰區參加新手對戰則可獲贈1包Play Booster。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/553c3a4f102430da6e65d2f15c5cc94811117c57fde2c769ebaece5dc1e3c6e2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe7df74699168c3e65578ddbd62433cf7.jpg\"/><p>以上就是MTG攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】香港世界同人展攤位報導！hololive等VTuber原創週邊應有盡有 🔸【ACGHK 2026】日本×香港共同製作電影「Another World(世外)」攤位報導！意外發現不知火舞痛車模型 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「MegaHouse」攤位報導！坐姿及貓化公仔應有盡有！「火影忍者」「咒術迴戰」等 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「Good Smile Company」「GOD HAND」攤位報導！從賽車初音到香港限定剪鉗，內容豐富！ 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「TAMASHII NATIONS」攤位報導！展示七龍珠、海賊王等珍貴公仔</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T03:40:28.429280+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":957,"images":13,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}